graph SECURITY_PRIVACY 1
entry SECURITY-001

gate SECURITY-001
context CODE_CHANGE
question "Are inputs, permissions, secrets, private data, and isolation handled according to the admitted security boundary?"
evidence threats,permissions,secrets,isolation
YES SECURITY-002
NO HARD-STOP-SECURITY
UNKNOWN HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-SECURITY
end

gate SECURITY-002
context CLOSURE
question "Are destructive, external, and release actions held for the Runtime authority with an exact bounded request?"
evidence authority,actions,request
YES COMPLETE
NO HARD-STOP-SECURITY
UNKNOWN HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-SECURITY
end

terminal COMPLETE COMPLETE "The security and privacy boundary is satisfied."
terminal HARD-STOP-SECURITY HARD_STOP "Security, privacy, or authority evidence failed."
terminal HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE HARD_STOP "Security cannot proceed on unknown evidence."

